---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import ContactCtaLink from "../../common/ContactCtaLink.astro";
import productsImage from "../../../assets/corporate-products-supply.png";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-canvas">
  <div class="relative z-1 mx-auto grid w-full max-w-360 gap-10 px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 md:gap-16 md:py-16 lg:px-14">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:min-h-[28rem] lg:grid-cols-[38.125rem_1fr] lg:items-center">
      <div class="reveal-section grid gap-5">
        <nav class="flex gap-2 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tracking-[0.12em] text-text-secondary" aria-label="パンくず">
          <a href="/">トップ</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span class="text-primary">取扱製品</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-primary">
          PRODUCTS &amp; MAKERS
        </p>
        <h1 class="max-w-152 font-serif text-[2.5rem] font-semibold leading-[1.22] md:text-5xl">
          製造現場に必要な製品を、確かなメーカー網で。
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-148 text-base leading-[1.85] text-text-secondary">
          駆動・伝動、空圧・油圧、工具、測定、搬送、工場設備まで。全18カテゴリ・延べ約320社の取扱メーカーから、製品の選定と調達に応えます。
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <ContactCtaLink href="/contact" size="lg" data-testid="products-link-contact">
            製品について相談する
            <span class="font-mono text-xs" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </ContactCtaLink>
          <a class="text-[0.9375rem] font-medium" href="#products-category-list">
            カテゴリ一覧を見る
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="products-hero-media reveal-section relative min-h-[26.25rem] overflow-hidden border border-divider bg-surface-media">
        <Image
          src={productsImage}
          alt="機械工具・関連機器"
          width={784}
          height={502}
          widths={[392, 784, 1176]}
          sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw"
          format="webp"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="products-hero-media-overlay absolute inset-0 bg-overlay-photo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="products-hero-media-caption absolute bottom-6 left-6 bg-overlay-panel px-4 py-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">機械工具・関連機器</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tracking-[0.1em] text-text-secondary">
            駆動・伝動 / 工具・測定 / 搬送 / 工場設備
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
